PicoStation CS

Fork of megavolt85/PicoStation, itself derived from Team-Resurgent/PicoStation
and paulocode/picostation. Existing copyright and license notices are retained.

The RC5 reference machine-level representation and menu image resources were
recovered from the publicly released PU18 non-overclocked RC5 firmware provided
for this project. They are identified as recovered material, not newly authored
original RC5 C/C++ source.

The menu builds on spicyjpeg/ps1-bare-metal and the PSXProject contributors.
Existing upstream source files carry their own notices. Font and default logo
resources in PicoStation Menu Editor/assets originate from the RC5 menu.

The host-side UCL compressor is Copyright Markus F.X.J. Oberhumer and licensed
under GPL-2.0-or-later. Its complete source and license are supplied by the
pinned third_party/ucl Git submodule. It is a host build tool.

New CS extension and editor code: Apache-2.0, except where otherwise noted.
